	"name": "Blinding Shot",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/ammunition/arrow-broadhead-glowing-orange.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>In some situations disrupting your target is a more reasonable expectation than killing them with one shot. Make a ranged weapon attack against a target within range to deal weapon damage and force a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, your target is [[/condition id=blinded]] for up to 1 minute or until an action is spent to clear the blood from their eyes. On a critical hit your target loses an eye permanently, regardless of the result of the saving throw.</p>",
